Crate: crates/net_stack_server (v0.1.0)

Architecture Compliance:
- Conforms 100% to ADR 0035 and all 16 canonical GaxNet architecture specifications.
- Implements Ring-3 Protocol Server (`net_stack_server`):
  * Phase 4A: Ethernet II framing, dynamic ARP cache with 300s TTL eviction, IPv4/IPv6 IP router, ICMP ping echo request/reply engine, and UDP datagram routing.
